        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**Stacks !** Stack of shortcuts for your dock, like the stacks of Mac OS X Leopard, on iOS 16 !\n\nSwipe up on an icon of your dock and a curved stack of up to 5 apps, web clips or web apps comes out of it !",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "🛒 <b>Havoc shop:</b> <a href=\"https://havoc.app/package/stacks\" style=\"color:#1F7AFF\">https://havoc.app/package/stacks</a>",
          "useSpacing": true,
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "# ***Features* :**",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**• A stack on your dock :**\n- Choose any app of your dock by touching it in the settings preview, and up to 5 apps, web clips or web apps for its stack.\n- Swipe up on that dock icon to open the stack, tap an icon to launch it, tap anywhere else to close it.\n- A small grabber above the dock icon shows where your stack is.\n\n**• Mac OS X Leopard style :**\n- The icons lie flat against a bent plank.\n- 3 styles : the stack curves from the dock (style 1), after the 1st icon (style 2) or after the 2nd icon (style 3).\n- Adjust the curvature with a slider, and curve the stack to the left or to the right.\n- The icons slide out of the dock icon along the plank, and slide back the same way.\n\n**• App names :**\n- Show the name of the apps to the left, to the right or below their icon, following the curve of the stack.\n- Mac OS style or iOS style.\n\n**• Customize the background and the animation :**\n- Adjust the blur and the dimming of the background, from 0 to 100 %.\n- Adjust the speed of the opening / closing animation.\n\n**• Live preview :**\n- A preview of your dock and your stack in the settings, updated as you move the sliders.\n\n**• Compatible with FiveIconDock.**",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
